NOTE ON ENGINE CODE

This repository currently contains the FORMAT (specification) and LIBRARY (content)
pillars of LIBER, both under CC BY-SA 4.0.

Engine code (generation, lifecycle maintenance, runtime serving, analytics), when
released, will be licensed separately under the Apache License 2.0. That code is
not part of this repository at this time.
